'''Mega Kangaskhan ex''' (Japanese: '''メガガルーラex''' ''Mega Garura ex'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

